<div class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col gap-10 px-4 py-12">
  <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 text-slate-200">
    <div class="space-y-2">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.45em] text-brand-gold">Seat Selection</p>
      <h1 class="font-heading text-3xl text-white md:text-4xl"><%= @movie.name %></h1>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-slate-500">
        <span><%= Date.parse(@date.to_s).strftime('%Y.%m.%d') rescue @date %></span>
        <span><%= @schedule.start_time.strftime('%H:%M') %> - <%= @schedule.end_time.strftime('%H:%M') %></span>
        <span>Screen <%= @schedule.screen_id %></span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <%= link_to '上映スケジュールに戻る', movie_path(@movie, date: @date), class: 'btn-secondary text-xs sm:text-sm' %>
  </div>

  <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3">
    <aside class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/60 p-6 text-sm text-slate-300 shadow-lg">
      <p class="font-semibold text-brand-gold">予約概要</p>
      <dl class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-slate-200">
        <div class="flex justify-between gap-3 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-slate-500">
          <span>作品</span>
          <span><%= @movie.name %></span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex justify-between gap-3 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-slate-500">
          <span>上映日</span>
          <span><%= Date.parse(@date.to_s).strftime('%Y/%m/%d') rescue @date %></span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex justify-between gap-3 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-slate-500">
          <span>時間</span>
          <span><%= @schedule.start_time.strftime('%H:%M') %>〜<%= @schedule.end_time.strftime('%H:%M') %></span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex justify-between gap-3 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-slate-500">
          <span>スクリーン</span>
          <span><%= @schedule.screen_id %></span>
        </div>
      </dl>
      <p class="mt-6 leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
        空席を選択すると予約フォームに進みます。予約済みの座席は選択できません。
      </p>
    </aside>

    <div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-6">
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/60 p-6 shadow-lg">
        <p class="text-center text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-slate-400">Screen</p>
        <% if @sheets.present? %>
          <div class="seat-grid mt-6">
            <% grouped_sheets = @sheets.group_by(&:row).sort_by { |row, _| row } %>
            <% grouped_sheets.each do |row, sheets| %>
              <div class="seat-row" aria-label="row <%= row.upcase %>">
                <span class="seat-row__label"><%= row.upcase %></span>
                <div class="seat-row__grid">
                  <% sheets.sort_by(&:column).each do |sheet| %>
                    <% seat_label = "#{row.upcase}-#{sheet.column}" %>
                    <% reserved = @reserved_sheets.include?(sheet.id) %>

                    <% if reserved %>
                      <span class="seat-pill seat-pill--reserved" aria-disabled="true"><%= seat_label %></span>
                    <% else %>
                      <%= link_to seat_label,
                                  new_movie_schedule_reservation_path(@movie, @schedule, date: @date, sheet_id: sheet.id),
                                  class: 'seat-pill seat-pill--available',
                                  data: { turbo: false } %>
                    <% end %>
                  <% end %>
                </div>
              </div>
            <% end %>
          </div>
        <% else %>
          <div class="empty-state mt-6">
            <strong class="text-accent">座席情報が見つかりません</strong>
            <p class="text-soft text-sm">スクリーンに紐づく座席が未登録の可能性があります。管理画面から座席を追加してください。</p>
          </div>
        <% end %>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 text-xs text-slate-400">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><span class="seat-pill seat-pill--sample-available"></span> 選択可能</span>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><span class="seat-pill seat-pill--sample-reserved"></span> 予約済み</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
